{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/65c138f13f77acc05f820a2eb36f0879.poster.avif?t=1772817398\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/65c138f13f77acc05f820a2eb36f0879.webm?t=1772817398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/65c138f13f77acc05f820a2eb36f0879.mp4?t=1772817398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A young man named Selim Kara is found dead under mysterious circumstances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a camera is connected to his computer, the system becomes corrupted and its files turn unreadable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an agent at the National Intelligence Center.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your assignment is simple: recover the files.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcbe WELCOME BACK TO 2005... BUT DIFFERENT.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/8fa25dcd144f78eda2beebb8f4a843aa.poster.avif?t=1772817398\" width=800 height=110 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/8fa25dcd144f78eda2beebb8f4a843aa.webm?t=1772817398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/8fa25dcd144f78eda2beebb8f4a843aa.mp4?t=1772817398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boot into a strangely familiar desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old and slow, but just as much fun internet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those old programs you'd forgotten existed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f THEY ARE PRETENDING TO BE A HUMAN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/1bd59b2a858d2e462645d53ca935fe9a.poster.avif?t=1772817398\" width=580 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/1bd59b2a858d2e462645d53ca935fe9a.webm?t=1772817398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/1bd59b2a858d2e462645d53ca935fe9a.mp4?t=1772817398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you dig deeper, you begin to question what's real and w\u0336\u0315\u034a\u0350\u030a\u0308\u0315\u0360\u030c\u0312\u0311\u0315\u031ch\u0335\u0360\u0314\u030f\u030b\u030f\u034a\u034a\u0333\u034d\u0330\u0347\u0329\u0321\u033c\u034d\u031c\u0332\u031c\u0327a\u0334\u0305\u035d\u035d\u030c\u0344\u0310\u0309\u030b\u030e\u0322\u0355\u0324\u0324\u034d\u035a\u0327\u0324\u035a\u0354\u0317t\u0338\u0300\u0333\u031e\u032c\u0354\u0356\u0326\u0320 \u0334\u0351\u0301\u0308\u0310\u0304\u034b\u031a\u0357\u030a\u0309\u035d\u0358\u030b\u0312\u034e\u0330\u0359\u0354\u0328\u031e\u032b\u033a\u0325\u0320i\u0338\u0357\u030b\u0360\u0301\u0310\u0302\u0302\u0341\u0310\u0309\u032a\u0347\u0321\u0353s\u0337\u033f\u0311\u0314\u030e\u0311\u0360\u0339\u0353\u031d\u0347\u032f\u033a\u034e\u0345\u0329 \u0335\u033f\u0312\u0340\u0332\u0347n\u0336\u030e\u0308\u0308\u0343\u030e\u0304\u0352\u0312\u031d\u0349\u0354\u0331\u0356\u0329\u0328\u034e\u033b\u032e\u0326\u033b\u035c\u034e\u032do\u0337\u033d\u0300\u0346\u0308\u033e\u030e\u0332\u0332\u0331\u0320\u0319t\u0336\u0340\u034b\u0301\u0343\u0315\u0306\u030b\u0301\u030c\u031d.\u0335\u0314\u0312\u0357\u0303\u0303\u0301\u0308\u031e\u0317\u0330\u032d\u0324\u0332\u0329\u0349\u0321\u0354\u0330\u0323\u033b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange behaviors. Files written by themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is hidden inside, born not from code, but from memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's learning. It's listening. And it wants to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddec TURQUOISE TECHNOLOGIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/534d18c8722dccd7bcafc114eeba8b9a.poster.avif?t=1772817398\" width=800 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/534d18c8722dccd7bcafc114eeba8b9a.webm?t=1772817398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/534d18c8722dccd7bcafc114eeba8b9a.mp4?t=1772817398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turquoise Technologies is a rising star in the global technology sector with its breakthroughs and ambitious vision in the field of artificial intelligence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, behind closed doors, a secret program known as <strong>Project Heaven</strong> was launched.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcfc STEP INTO THE VIDEOS - <i>Face fears that aren't yours</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/cfa20e298c4d1ab754398e125bf71cf6.poster.avif?t=1772817398\" width=800 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/cfa20e298c4d1ab754398e125bf71cf6.webm?t=1772817398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/cfa20e298c4d1ab754398e125bf71cf6.mp4?t=1772817398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selim Kara\u2019s final memories aren\u2019t just recorded, they\u2019re playable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each deciphered video transforms into a dark adventure from a first-person perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk through landscapes created by memories. <strong>Face fears that aren't yours</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f NOSTALGIA AS YOU WANT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/fd10bf6dbf73d9e6ae9069a499b54609.poster.avif?t=1772817398\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/fd10bf6dbf73d9e6ae9069a499b54609.webm?t=1772817398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817240/extras/fd10bf6dbf73d9e6ae9069a499b54609.mp4?t=1772817398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We didn\u2019t just simulate the past, we rebuilt it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the web design of the early 2000s to the loud computers and the old-looking OS, everything is lovingly crafted to capture a time that's gone... but not forgotten.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully interactive retro desktop interface </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No HUD, no tutorials, just you, your instincts, and the machine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four <strong>playable memory-videos</strong>, each unlocking deeper psychological layers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nostalgic 2000s internet: from forums to fake websites</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully crafted <strong>nostalgic atmosphere</strong>, not just visual, but emotional</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Full Story","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3817240/4c9610177dc60a8915e6010c75cb5070bd267b5f.jpg"},{"name":"Jenny Darling","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3817240/48bab80813198eb79867a7ed3ec1a183e2509fdc.jpg"},{"name":"Cameraman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3817240/7dae959d288ad0e62c4b95f7846e1fe16a14dd59.jpg"},{"name":"Searching for the Lost","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3817240/1c9effc05cb5da1d0e0ffc6d1f011d0f52c62321.jpg"},{"name":"For Mom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3817240/c96ff5c2a606a74d481d1c4b71e313a0450b9bb9.jpg"},{"name":"Synthetic Memories","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3817240/ffe5eb7ee2691787042be1bb8f61487633445e95.jpg"},{"name":"Lingering Souls","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3817240/fcab3f636f9b3facdcb8fd656b6e03f784c9e603.jpg"},{"name":"Mental Fortitude","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3817240/03708e7f75c066baee75f2ed3bdda7a6e6ea5629.jpg"},{"name":"Into the Rabbit Hole","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3817240/337eca0186486539b124d3a112f4fb1bc63d4756.jpg"},{"name":"Star-Crossed Lovers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3817240/b7a127f03736cd88ef03b7d31caa3e35d49b0ce5.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3817240?t=1772817398","back